    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Resilience to seasonal peak loads: As mentioned earlier, Our platform's can scale horizontally and provide resilience to peak loads, making Resilience to seasonal peak loads FULLY COVERED. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with existing information systems and user directories: Our platform's supports API-first design (REST + webhook) and can integrate with existing tools through connectors and adapters provided by our delivery partner Ligeo Conseil, including accounting-production and payroll software, document-management systems, and electronic-invoicing environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our support SSO via SAML and OIDC, as well as user directories like LDAP and Entra ID." ;
